INSERT INTO `activity` VALUES (1,'Cricket seniors','cricket-seniors','<div>L\'√©quipe senior est ouverte √† tous √† partir de 19 ans et jusqu\'√†...99 ans !<br><br></div><div>Notre √©quipe senior s\'entraine deux fois par semaine :<br>le mercredi de 16h √† 18h au Stade Marcel Rouvi√®re<br>le samedi de 12h √† 14h sur le terrain 8 du Complexe Sportif La Bastide<br><br></div><div>La saison des comp√©titions commence en Avril.</div><div>Nous jouons en comp√©tition avec les √©quipes d\'ACCSO (Clubs de Toulouse, Catus, Montpellier, Damazan) et en matchs amicaux avec les √©quipes de Lyon, Riviera Cricket Club, Beausoleil, Avignon, Montpellier, N√Æmes, Al√®s.</div><div>Vous √™tes joueur exp√©riment√© ou d√©butant ?<br><br></div><h1><a href=\"https://www.helloasso.com/associations/nimescricketclub/adhesions/adherer-au-nimes-cricket-club\">Rejoignez-nous !</a></h1>','2024-03-03-0351484a-aec1-4379-87cf-c23f8d1c36e5.jpg','2024-03-03 15:16:13','2025-02-18 14:43:34','Cricket seniors','<div>The senior team is open to everyone from 19 years old and up to...99 years old!</div>\n<div>Our senior team trains twice a week:<br>Wednesday from 4pm to 6pm at Stade Marcel Rouvi√®re<br>Saturday from 12pm to 2pm on field 8 of Complexe Sportif La Bastide<br></div>\n<div>The competition season starts in April.</div>\n<div>We play in competition with the teams of ACCSO (Clubs of Toulouse, Catus, Montpellier, Damazan) and in friendly matches with the teams of Lyon, Riviera Cricket Club, Beausoleil, Avignon, Montpellier, N√Æmes, Al√®s.</div>\n<div>Are you an experienced player or a beginner?</div>\n<h1><a href=\"https://www.helloasso.com/associations/nimescricketclub/adhesions/adherer-au-nimes-cricket-club\">Join us!</a></h1>','a17cd10db6ab649746c99f7e350007b0:f206dad73d0a2d0153b8492d332f09c0'),(2,'Ecole de cricket','ecole-de-cricket','<h1>Apprenez √† jouer au cricket toute l\'ann√©e !</h1><div><br><strong>Les mercredis apr√®s-midi, √† N√Æmes :</strong><br>- de 14h √† 15h pour les 6-10 ans<br>- de 15h √† 16h30 pour les 10-16 ans<br>Lieu : N√Æmes, stade Marcel Rouvi√®re<br><br><strong>Les samedis √† Dions :<br></strong>- de 10h √† 11h pour les 6-10 ans<br>- de 11h √† 12h30 pour les 10-16 ans<br>- de 14h √† 16h pour les adultes et + de 16 ans<br>Lieu : Dions, terrain de cricket<br><br></div><div><strong>Tarifs √† l\'ann√©e&nbsp; (adh√©sion, licence et assurance comprises) : </strong><br>- 6-10 ans : 90‚Ç¨ (soft ball, 1h de pratique hebdo)<br>- 10-16 ans : 120‚Ç¨ (hard ball, 1h30 de pratique hebdo)<br>- + de 16 ans, adultes : 150‚Ç¨ (hard ball, 2h de pratique hebdo)<br><br>R√©duit (Demandeurs d\'emploi, RSA, √©tudiant) : 90‚Ç¨ <br>Prise en charge CCAS et dispositif Pass\'Sport possible.<br><br>En cadeau de bienvenue : une casquette, une balle et une batte !<br><br>En bonus : Pratiquez votre anglais √† chaque s√©ance&nbsp; avec nos animateurs anglophones !<br><br>Retrouvez-nous aussi pour des<strong> s√©ances d√©couverte du cricket <br></strong>en famille ou entre amis :<br><strong>Tous les premiers dimanche du mois <br></strong>√† Dions, terrain de cricket <br>de 10h √† 12h<strong><br>Tarif : </strong>5‚Ç¨ la s√©ance par personne, gratuit pour les adh√©rents<br><br>Et nos <strong>stages Cricket en anglais</strong>, √† chaque vacance scolaire !<br><br><br></div><h1><a href=\"https://www.helloasso.com/associations/nimescricketclub/adhesions/adherer-au-nimes-cricket-club\">INSCRIVEZ-VOUS !</a></h1><div><br><figure data-trix-attachment=\"{&quot;contentType&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;filename&quot;:&quot;image.png&quot;,&quot;filesize&quot;:351354,&quot;height&quot;:649,&quot;href&quot;:&quot;/attachments/68118e30-01f9-4af2-a795-82c37e2e981d.png&quot;,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;/attachments/68118e30-01f9-4af2-a795-82c37e2e981d.png&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:923}\" data-trix-content-type=\"image/png\" data-trix-attributes=\"{&quot;presentation&quot;:&quot;gallery&quot;}\" class=\"attachment attachment--preview attachment--png\"><a href=\"/attachments/68118e30-01f9-4af2-a795-82c37e2e981d.png\"><img src=\"/attachments/68118e30-01f9-4af2-a795-82c37e2e981d.png\" width=\"923\" height=\"649\"><figcaption class=\"attachment__caption\"><span class=\"attachment__name\">image.png</span> <span class=\"attachment__size\">343.12 KB</span></figcaption></a></figure></div><div>&nbsp;</div><h1><br></h1><div>&nbsp;</div>','2024-03-03-a1bcaaf1-42d7-49c2-a3e2-8942393c512c.jpg','2024-03-03 15:16:24','2025-09-10 06:56:10','Cricket school','<h1>Learn to play cricket all year round!</h1><div><br><strong>Wednesday afternoons, in N√Æmes:</strong><br>- from 2pm to 3pm for 6-10 year olds<br>- from 3pm to 4:30pm for 10-16 year olds<br>Location: N√Æmes, Marcel Rouvi√®re Stadium<br><br><strong>Saturdays in Dions:</strong><br>- from 10am to 11am for 6-10 year olds<br>- from 11am to 12:30pm for 10-16 year olds<br>- from 2pm to 4pm for adults and 16+<br>Location: Dions, cricket ground<br><br></div><div><strong>Annual fees</strong> (membership, license, and insurance included):<br>- 6-10 years: ‚Ç¨90 (soft ball, 1 hour weekly)<br>- 10-16 years: ‚Ç¨120 (hard ball, 1.5 hours weekly)<br>- 16+, adults: ‚Ç¨150 (hard ball, 2 hours weekly)<br><br>Discounted (unemployed, RSA, students): ‚Ç¨90<br>CCAS coverage and Pass\'Sport scheme available.<br><br>Welcome gift: a cap, a ball, and a bat!<br><br>Bonus: Practice your English at every session with our English-speaking coaches!<br><br>Join us also for <strong>cricket discovery sessions</strong> with family or friends:<br><strong>Every first Sunday of the month</strong> in Dions, cricket ground<br>from 10am to 12pm<br><strong>Fee:</strong> ‚Ç¨5 per person per session, free for members<br><br>And our <strong>Cricket Camps in English</strong>, during every school holiday!<br><br><br></div><h1><a href=\"https://www.helloasso.com/associations/nimescricketclub/adhesions/adherer-au-nimes-cricket-club\">SIGN UP!</a></h1><div><br><figure data-trix-attachment=\"{&quot;contentType&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;filename&quot;:&quot;image.png&quot;,&quot;filesize&quot;:351354,&quot;height&quot;:649,&quot;href&quot;:&quot;/attachments/68118e30-01f9-4af2-a795-82c37e2e981d.png&quot;,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;/attachments/68118e30-01f9-4af2-a795-82c37e2e981d.png&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:923}\" data-trix-content-type=\"image/png\" data-trix-attributes=\"{&quot;presentation&quot;:&quot;gallery&quot;}\" class=\"attachment attachment--preview attachment--png\"><a href=\"/attachments/68118e30-01f9-4af2-a795-82c37e2e981d.png\"><img src=\"/attachments/68118e30-01f9-4af2-a795-82c37e2e981d.png\" width=\"923\" height=\"649\"><figcaption class=\"attachment__caption\"><span class=\"attachment__name\">image.png</span> <span class=\"attachment__size\">343.12 KB</span></figcaption></a></figure></div><div>&nbsp;</div><h1><br></h1><div>&nbsp;</div>','df28cf1437c44204b109195d5c8671f0:d4e51f410b30e31c50563d4ab2cdfc24'),(3,'Cricket f√©minin','cricket-feminin','<div>Le saviez-vous ?</div><div>L\'histoire du cricket f√©minin s\'ancre d√®s le d√©but dans les origines du cricket. Les femmes ont toujours jou√© au cricket et continuent encore aujourd\'hui a remporter de belles victoires dans les comp√©titions internationales.</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>Le d√©veloppement du cricket f√©minin junior et adulte est une des priorit√©s du club et pour cela un cr√©neau de pratique hebdomadaire est ouvert :</div><div>le samedi matin de 10h √† 11h30</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>Alors mesdames, n\'h√©sitez pas :<br><br></div><h1><a href=\"https://nimescricketclub.fr/contact\"><strong>Contactez-nous !</strong></a></h1><div>&nbsp;</div><div>&nbsp;</div>','2024-03-03-0893bf7c-4024-4ed9-b547-31463823f93f.jpg','2024-03-03 15:16:37','2025-02-18 14:43:34','Women\'s cricket','<div>Did you know?</div><div>The history of women\'s cricket is rooted in the origins of cricket. Women have always played cricket and continue to win in international competitions today.</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>The development of junior and adult women\'s cricket is a priority for the club, and a weekly practice slot is available:</div><div>Saturdays from 10:00 to 11:30</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>So ladies, don\'t hesitate:</div><h1><a href=\"https://nimescricketclub.fr/contact\"><strong>Contact us!</strong></a></h1><div>&nbsp;</div><div>&nbsp;</div>','b263741ad0b3ebd1e81be4517689c171:cc6ab1c144c55768b6a78d086c193f5e'),(4,'Cricket scolaire et universitaire','cricket-scolaire-et-universitaire','<div>Sur demande, nous intervenons dans les √©coles primaires, coll√®ges, lyc√©es et universit√©.</div><div>Plusieurs options sont possibles :</div><div>- Atelier de d√©couverte du cricket :</div><div>dans votre √©tablissement, atelier de d√©couverte du cricket d\'1h √† 3h qui peut √©ventuellement s\'accompagner d\'une pr√©sentation th√©orique en amont.</div><div>Proposition √† adapter en fonction de vos possibilit√©s et de vos souhaits.</div><div>En 2023 nous sommes ainsi intervenus :</div><div>- au coll√®ge priv√© de Lasalle √† N√Æmes</div><div>- √† l\'universit√© de N√Æmes, en licence STAPS</div><div>- Cycle d\'initiation au cricket <strong>en anglais </strong>:</div><div>un cycle de 5 s√©ances de 45mn, pour s\'initier progressivement aux gestes et aux r√®gles du cricket.</div><div>Ce cycle peut se d√©rouler sur le temps scolaire et peut se d√©cliner de mani√®re transversale avec d\'autres disciplines : histoire du cricket, g√©ographie du cricket, culture et esprit du cricket et m√™me gastronomie du cricket !</div><div>Le cycle est valid√© par une c√©r√©monie de remise de m√©dailles et de dipl√¥mes, toujours tr√®s appr√©ci√©e des enfants !</div><div>Pour plus de renseignement et pour construire avec vous cette intervention, n\'h√©sitez pas :</div><h1><a href=\"https://nimescricketclub.fr/contact\">Contactez-nous !</a></h1><div><br>T√©l√©charger la brochure Cricket Scolaire <strong>en anglais</strong></div>','2024-03-03-d86af379-e2f7-4eee-b127-9a2f8aba91cc.jpg','2024-03-03 15:16:50','2025-02-18 14:43:34','School cricket','<div>On request, we intervene in primary schools, colleges, high schools and universities.</div><div>Several options are possible:</div><div>- Cricket discovery workshop:</div><div>in your establishment, cricket discovery workshop of 1 to 3 hours which can optionally be accompanied by a theoretical presentation beforehand.</div><div>Proposal to be adapted according to your possibilities and your wishes.</div><div>In 2023 we have thus intervened:</div><div>- at the private college of Lasalle in N√Æmes</div><div>- at the University of N√Æmes, in the STAPS license</div><div>- Cricket initiation cycle <strong>in English</strong>:</div><div>a cycle of 5 sessions of 45 minutes, to gradually learn the gestures and rules of cricket.</div><div>This cycle can take place during school hours and can be adapted in a cross-disciplinary manner with other disciplines: history of cricket, geography of cricket, cricket culture and spirit, and even cricket gastronomy!</div><div>The cycle is validated by a ceremony of medal and diploma award, always very appreciated by the children!</div><div>For more information and to build this intervention with you, do not hesitate:</div><h1><a href=\"https://nimescricketclub.fr/contact\">Contact us!</a></h1><div><br>Download the Cricket School brochure <strong>in English</strong></div>','6575297d8fe54ab11699d144ae2f55c2:10dbc19842c6bf7257c944c6e9d33e90'),(5,'Cricket en entreprise','cricket-en-entreprise','<div>le N√Æmes Cricket Club vous propose d\'organiser, au sein de votre entreprise, un √©v√©nement autour du cricket.</div><div>Par exemple, nous pouvons proposer une s√©ance de d√©couverte du cricket suivie d\'un buffet gastronomique, servi par nos joueurs !</div><div>Pour plus de renseignements et pour construire avec vous cet √©v√©nement sur mesure :</div><h1><a href=\"https://nimescricketclub.fr/contact\">Contactez-nous !</a></h1>','2024-03-03-cc5b88c6-1fbe-441b-a9fa-d3e1fc93791f.jpg','2024-03-03 15:17:01','2025-02-18 14:43:34','Cricket in the workplace','<div>The N√Æmes Cricket Club offers to organize, within your company, an event around cricket.</div><div>For example, we can propose a discovery session of cricket followed by a gourmet buffet, served by our players!</div><div>For more information and to build with you this tailor-made event:</div><h1><a href=\"https://nimescricketclub.fr/contact\">Contact us!</a></h1>','41e0a0fea5ac2ddd674b58dd6b288de1:ef16d0429c97aff35c65ed95d430f1d7'),(6,'Cricket dans les quartiers','cricket-dans-les-quartiers','<div>&nbsp;Nous intervenons r√©guli√®rement dans les quartiers relevant de la Politique de la Ville √† N√Æmes : <strong>Pissevin-Valdegour</strong>, <strong>Chemin Bas d\'Avignon</strong>, <strong>Clos d\'Orville</strong> et <strong>Mas de Mingue</strong>, afin de faire d√©couvrir le cricket aux habitantes et habitants. Ces actions contribuent √† enrichir la dynamique sociale et culturelle de ces quartiers.<br><br></div><div>Ce que nous proposons :<br><br></div><ul><li><strong>Ateliers d√©couverte pour le grand public</strong><br> Organis√©s lors des temps forts qui rythment la vie des quartiers, ces ateliers permettent √† tous de s\'initier au cricket dans une ambiance conviviale.<br><br></li><li><strong>Cycles d\'initiation au cricket</strong><br> Des cycles compos√©s de <strong>5 s√©ances</strong>, en partenariat avec les centres sociaux et les associations locales, pour un apprentissage approfondi et progressif.<br><br></li></ul><div>Vous √™tes une association ou un collectif d\'habitants ?<br><br></div><div>Vous souhaitez collaborer avec nous pour d√©velopper une initiative dans votre quartier ?<br><br><strong>Contactez-nous pour construire ensemble une proposition adapt√©e √† vos besoins et aspirations.<br></strong><br></div><div><br></div><h1><a href=\"https://nimescricketclub.fr/contact\">Contactez-nous !</a></h1>','2024-03-03-74bfca7c-f7c9-4872-bb99-3a5efeb76350.jpg','2024-03-03 15:17:11','2025-02-18 14:43:34','Cricket in the neighborhoods','<div>&nbsp;We intervene regularly in the neighborhoods under the Urban Policy in N√Æmes: <strong>Pissevin-Valdegour</strong>, <strong>Chemin Bas d\'Avignon</strong>, <strong>Clos d\'Orville</strong> and <strong>Mas de Mingue</strong>, to introduce cricket to the inhabitants. These actions contribute to enrich the social and cultural dynamics of these neighborhoods.<br><br></div><div>What we offer:<br><br></div><ul><li><strong>Discovery workshops for the general public</strong><br> Organized during the major events that mark the life of the neighborhoods, these workshops allow everyone to learn cricket in a friendly atmosphere.<br><br></li><li><strong>Cricket initiation cycles</strong><br> Cycles composed of <strong>5 sessions</strong>, in partnership with community centers and local associations, for a progressive and in-depth learning.<br><br></li></ul><div>Are you an association or a group of residents?<br><br></div><div>Do you want to collaborate with us to develop an initiative in your neighborhood?<br><br><strong>Contact us to build together a proposal tailored to your needs and aspirations.<br></strong><br></div><div><br></div><h1><a href=\"https://nimescricketclub.fr/contact\">Contact us!</a></h1>','72328970628c985706b0c20f5113d834:df70d8a7fcbb9a89dae65656da312fc9');
