Allifullah, Muneeb and Taher, the two excellent catches of Nimatullah. and congratulations to Gulab, Sheroz and Nasir, our batting stars !<br><br></div><div>As a reminder, the N√Æmes Cricket Club will also play in the T20 final on August 18th, also organized by ACCSO. This match will oppose the 3 victorious teams of the 3 pools of Nouvelle-Aquitaine and Occitanie: Eyliac, Toulouse (Wolves) and N√Æmes (Crocs).<br><br></div><div>So, fingers crossed for these two finals and wish them good luck !<br><br></div><h1><strong><em>Follow us !!!</em></strong></h1><div><a href=\"https://www.crichq.com/draws/60524/rounds/finals\">https://www.crichq.com/draws/60524/rounds/finals</a><br><br><br></div>','2bc23af5d6f1f0a47d960b280586d58e:65ee076e83c56d6fd78bdd5e3afb136a',1,'1970-01-01 00:00:00'),(8,'Champions interr√©gionaux ACCSO 2024 T20','accso-t20-championnat-2024','<div><figure data-trix-attachment=\"{&quot;contentType&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;filename&quot;:&quot;WhatsApp Image 2024-08-18 √† 21.48.54_02d7e001.jpg&quot;,&quot;filesize&quot;:486476,&quot;height&quot;:2048,&quot;href&quot;:&quot;/attachments/2059379e-4a51-4e6b-848a-d87544027594.jpg&quot;,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;/attachments/2059379e-4a51-4e6b-848a-d87544027594.jpg&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:1536}\" data-trix-content-type=\"image/jpeg\" data-trix-attributes=\"{&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;CAPTAIN&quot;,&quot;presentation&quot;:&quot;gallery&quot;}\" class=\"attachment attachment--preview attachment--jpg\"><a href=\"/attachments/2059379e-4a51-4e6b-848a-d87544027594.jpg\"><img src=\"/attachments/2059379e-4a51-4e6b-848a-d87544027594.jpg\" width=\"1536\" height=\"2048\"><figcaption class=\"attachment__caption attachment__caption--edited\">CAPTAIN</figcaption></a></figure></div><div class=\"attachment-gallery attachment-gallery--3\"><figure data-trix-attachment=\"{&quot;contentType&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;filename&quot;:&quot;240513-Match 3-T20-NCC vs Tlse.JPG&quot;,&quot;filesize&quot;:1251155,&quot;heigh