s-midi.</div><div><br></div><div>Nous avons eu l\'honneur de recevoir la visite de plusieurs √©lus, dont Julien Plantier Premier Adjoint au Maire de N√Æmes, d√©l√©gu√© √† l‚Äôurbanisme et Conseiller d√©partemental du Gard, Franck Proust, Pr√©sident de N√Æmes M√©tropole, Olivier Bonn√©&nbsp; Adjoint au Maire d√©l√©gu√© au suivi de la R√©novation Urbaine ainsi que Fran√ßois Courdil, Adjoint au maire, D√©l√©gu√© √† la politique de la ville et aux centres sociaux, Pr√©sident du conseil de quartier Gr√©zan Chemin Bas-d‚ÄôAvignon.&nbsp;<br><br></div><div>Nous tenons √† remercier chaleureusement tous les participants pour leur fid√©lit√© et leur engagement constant. Gr√¢ce √† eux, \"Quartiers en f√™te\" a une fois de plus √©t√© une r√©ussite.</div><div><br><strong><em>Merci √† tout l\'√©quipe de l\'espace L√©on Vergnole&nbsp;</em></strong></div><div><br></div>','2024-10-07-008415b9-2839-4aa1-862a-1074fdcbd338.png','2024-10-07 12:37:51','2025-02-18 14:43:34','\"Quartiers en f√™te\" : A convivial and festive day at the L√©on Vergnole Space','<div>Saturday, October 5, 2024, the Espace L√©on Vergnole hosted \"Quartiers en f√™te\", an event that brought together many residents for a day full of joy and conviviality. Associations were present, providing support and commitment to make the day a true success.</div><div>The atmosphere was festive with lively music provided by a DJ throughout the event, as well as the captivating performance of a batucada, adding a rhythmic and festive touch to the afternoon.</div><div><br></div><div>We had the honor of receiving several elected officials, including Julien Plantier, First Deputy Mayor of N√Æmes, delegate for urban planning and departmental councilor of Gard, Franck Proust, President of N√Æmes M√©tropole, Olivier Bonn√© Adjoint au Maire delegate for the follow-up of urban renovation, as well as Fran√ßois Courdil, Adjoint au maire, delegate for the city policy and social centers, President of the Gr√©zan Chemin Bas-d‚ÄôAvignon neighborhood council.</div><div>We would like to thank all the participants warmly for their loyalty and constant commitment. Thanks to them, \"Quartiers en f√™te\" was once again a success.</div><div><br><strong><em>Thank you to the entire team of the Espace L√©on Vergnole</em></strong></div><div><br></div>','a3843dd4deee90cd3d06ad1883849204:16fa19e2374f1b969cc901b4eba82410',1,'1970-01-01 00:00:00'),(13,'Stage de CRICKET ‚Äì TOUSSAINT 2024','stage-de-cricket-toussaint-2024-du-23102024-au-25102024-de-9h-a-16h-complexe-sportif-la-bastide-30900-nimes','<div><br><br><strong>Stage ouvert aux enfants n√©s entre 2010 et 2018, gar√ßons et filles</strong></div><div>-&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Encadr√© par des entraineurs et √©ducateurs f√©d√©raux.</div><div>-&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Ouvert √† toutes et tous (licenci√©s ou non)</div><div>-&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Inscription : 70‚Ç¨ par stage ou 25‚Ç¨ par journ√©e. <br><br><strong>CONDITION GENERALES DU STAGE.<br></strong><br></div><div><strong>OBJECTIF DU STAGE :&nbsp;</strong></div><div>En plus de sa mission √©ducative, assur√©e par un encadrement form√© et comp√©tent, le club s‚Äôengage durant le stage √† enseigner le Cricket dans le respect des r√®glements et de la politique f√©d√©rale tout en cultivant l‚Äôesprit sportif.</div><div><strong>&nbsp;</strong></div><div><strong>LE CLUB S‚ÄôENGAGE A :</strong></div><div>Assurer la s√©curit√© des licenci√©s durant les horaires de fonctionnement du stage,</div><div>Donner la meilleure formation possible en mati√®re technique, physique et morale,</div><div>Mettre √† disposition des installations permettant de respecter les r√®gles √©l√©mentaires d‚Äôhygi√®ne,</div><div>Assurer la qualit√© et le service de la restauration (repas √©quilibr√©).</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div><strong>SOUS LA TUTELLE DE SES PARENTS, LE JOUEUR(EUSE) S‚ÄôENGAGE A :</strong></div><div>Respecter l‚Äôensemble des personnes intervenant durant le stage (√©ducateurs, dirigeants, parents),</div><div>Respecter lors des rencontres jou√©es, l‚Äôarbitre, ses partenaires et ses adversaires,&nbsp;</div><div>Participer et √™tre ponctuel,</div><div>Prendre le plus grand soin des installations, du mat√©riel et des √©quipements mis √† sa disposition,</div><div>Venir avec sa tenue de sport ainsi qu‚Äôune tenue compl√©mentaire pour les autres activit√©s,</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div><strong>LES PARENTS S‚ÄôENGAGENT A :</strong></div><div>Accompagner leur enfant le matin √† 9H00 sur le lieu du stage.</div><div>S‚Äôassurer de la pr√©sence de l‚Äôencadrement avant de repartir.</div><div>R√©cup√©rer leur enfant √† 16h sur le lieu du stage.</div><div>Respecter les horaires de d√©but et fin de journ√©e.</div><div>Pr√©venir l‚Äôencadrement en cas d‚Äôabsence ou de retard.</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div><strong>OBSERVATIONS :&nbsp;</strong></div><div><em>CONDITIONS FINANCIERES</em></div><div>Le montant comprend les frais de mat√©riel, de repas, go√ªters, dipl√¥mes, m√©dailles et d‚Äôactivit√©s, d‚Äôencadrement par du personnel dipl√¥m√© et la Responsabilit√© civile du club.&nbsp;</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>Le paiement s‚Äôeffectue lors de l‚Äôinscription de l‚Äôenfant par ch√®que, virement, en esp√®ces √† N√Æmes Cricket Club ou</div><div><a href=\"https://www.helloasso.com/associations/nimescricketclub/adhesions/stage-de-cricket-toussaint-2024\">https://www.helloasso.com/associations/nimescricketclub/adhesions/stage-de-cricket-toussaint-2024</a></div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>D√©sistement de la part du club dans le cadre d‚Äôun nombre inf√©rieur de stagiaires : remboursement des inscriptions.</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>D√©sistement de la part du stagiaire : celui-ci doit intervenir 5 jours avant le d√©but du stage, pass√© ce d√©lai aucun</div><div>remboursement des frais d‚Äôengagement ne sera effectu√© ou bien 50% de retenue.&nbsp;</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div><strong>EQUIPEMENT OBLIGATOIRE :</strong></div><div>Tenue sports (Maillot, short, chaussettes + tennis).</div><div>Tenue de pluie (coupe-vent).</div>','2024-10-10-632ffdd3-ce16-4aa4-b01d-fc9173706131.png','2024-10-10 14:08:28','2025-02-18 14:43:34','Cricket World Cup ‚Äì All Saints\' Day 2024','<div><br><br><strong>Stage open to children born between 2010 and 2018, boys and girls</strong></div><div>-&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Supervised by federal coaches and educators.</div><div>-&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Open to all (licensed or not)</div><div>-&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Registration: 70‚Ç¨ per stage or 25‚Ç¨ per day. <br><br><strong>GENERAL CONDITIONS OF THE STAGE.<br></strong><br></div><div><strong>OBJECTIVE OF THE STAGE :&nbsp;</strong></div><div>In addition to its educational mission, ensured by trained and competent staff, the club commits during the stage to teach cricket in accordance with regulations and federal policy while fostering a sporting spirit.</div><div><strong>&nbsp;</strong></div><div><strong>THE CLUB COMMITS TO :</strong></div><div>Ensure the safety of licensees during the operating hours of the stage,</div><div>Provide the best possible training in technical, physical, and moral matters,</div><div>Make available facilities that allow for compliance with basic hygiene rules,</div><div>Ensure the quality and service of catering (balanced meals).</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div><strong>UNDER THE SUPERVISION OF THEIR PARENTS, THE PLAYER(S) COMMITS TO :</strong></div><div>Respect all persons involved in the stage (educators, leaders, parents),</div><div>Respect the referee, partners, and opponents during matches,</div><div>Participate and be punctual,</div><div>Take the greatest care of the facilities, equipment, and equipment made available,</div><div>Come with sportswear as well as additional clothing for other activities,</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div><strong>PARENTS COMMIT TO :</strong></div><div>Accompany their child in the morning at 9:00 AM to the stage location.</div><div>Ensure the presence of the staff before leaving.</div><div>Pick up their child at 4:00 PM at the stage location.</div><div>Respect the start and end times of the day.</div><div>Notify the staff in case of absence or delay.</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div><strong>OBSERVATIONS :&nbsp;</strong></div><div><em>FINANCIAL CONDITIONS</em></div><div>The amount includes material, meal, snack, diploma, medal, and activity fees, as well as fees for qualified personnel and the club\'s civil liability.</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>Payment is made upon registration of the child by check, bank transfer, or cash to N√Æmes Cricket Club or</div><div><a href=\"https://www.helloasso.com/associations/nimescricketclub/adhesions/stage-de-cricket-toussaint-2024\">https://www.helloasso.com/associations/nimescricketclub/adhesions/stage-de-cricket-toussaint-2024</a></div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>Withdrawal by the club in the event of a lower number of participants: refund of registrations.</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>Withdrawal by the participant: it must be made 5 days before the start of the stage, after which no refund of the registration fee will be made or a 50% retention.</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div><strong>REQUIRED EQUIPMENT :</strong></div><div>Sportswear (jersey, shorts, socks + tennis shoes).</div><div>Rain gear (raincoat).</div>','0473037a73129ae08c075699d1360a3a:a35a11ee5b0ecf581bd01296fff9a14a',1,'1970-01-01 00:00:00'),(14,'Reprise de L\'√©cole de CRICKET','reprise-de-lecole-de-cricket-en-famille-et-amis','<div>Reprise de L\'√©cole&nbsp; de CRICKET !&nbsp;</div><div>Apr√®s les vacances scolaires, L\'√©cole de CRICKET en red√©marre ce mercredi 6 novembre de 14h √† 16h au Stade Marcel Rouvi√®re, 30900 N√Æmes.&nbsp;</div><div><br></div><div>Tous les jeunes de 6 √† 14 ans, filles et gar√ßons, sont les bienvenus pour venir d√©couvrir ce sport passionnant !</div><div>&nbsp;Les 3 premi√®res s√©ances sont gratuites&nbsp; - une belle opportunit√© pour essayer le cricket et faire partie de notre √©quipe !<br><br></div><div>N\'h√©sitez pas √† me contacter si vous avez des questions.</div><div>Au plaisir de vous voir sur le