 June 20 - NCC AGM & Women\'s Cricket Tournament</strong></h1>\n<div>A festive day packed with events!</div>\n<div><strong>Morning ‚Äì 10 AM to 12 PM<br>N√Æmes Cricket Club Annual General Meeting</strong></div>\n<div>On the agenda:</div>\n<ul><li>2025 year in review</li><li>future plans</li><li>renewal and reinforcement of the club‚Äôs active members<br><br></li></ul>\n<div>üëâ We are looking for volunteers to strengthen:</div>\n<ul><li>the board</li><li>the board of directors</li><li>occasional support teams</li></ul>\n<div>All goodwill is welcome!</div>\n<div>+</div>\n<div>Shared Picnic<br><br><strong>How much?</strong> Free contribution!</div>\n<div><strong>Where?</strong> Dions ‚Äì Guinguette de Dions and Dions Cricket Ground (opposite the Guinguette)</div>\n<div><strong>When?</strong> Saturday, June 20</div>\n<div><strong>How?</strong></div>\n<div>I‚Äôm attending by clicking the link: <a href=\"https://beta.framadate.org/polls/AG-NCC\"><strong>AGM REGISTRATION</strong></a><br><br></div>\n<div>---</div>\n<h1><strong>The afternoon ‚Äì 2 PM to 8 PM - Women\'s Cricket Tournament</strong></h1>\n<div>Come watch or participate in the first-ever women\'s cricket tournament in the history of Occitanie!</div>\n<div>In a joyful atmosphere open to all:</div>\n<ul><li>come and try cricket</li><li>join the tournament</li><li>form a team of 6 to 8 players</li></ul>\n<div>üëâ No team? Just come as you are: we‚Äôll form teams on-site!<br><br></div>\n<div>Men are, of course, welcome to come and cheer on the players!</div>\n<div>Free and joyful participation</div>\n<div>Music and barbecue after the awards. A great atmosphere guaranteed!<br><br></div>\n<div><strong>How much?</strong> From 5‚Ç¨ per participant for the tournament / Drinks and barbecue at a free and fair price<strong><br>Where?</strong> Dions Cricket Ground (opposite the Guinguette)</div>\n<div><strong>When?</strong> Saturday, June 20 ‚Äì 1:30 PM: Welcome and registration / 2 PM: Cricket initiation for all / 3:30 PM: Team formation / 4 PM: Tournament begins</div>\n<div><strong>How?</strong></div>\n<div>To play, register by clicking the link: <a href=\"https://www.helloasso.com/associations/nimescricketclub/evenements/festival-de-cricket-feminin-journee-internationale-des-droits-des-femmes-2026\"><strong>TOURNAMENT REGISTRATION</strong></a><br><br></div>\n<div>---<strong><br></strong>Finally, but still in the planning stage:</div>\n<div><strong>An Inter-School Tournament ‚Äì Grades 3 & 4</strong></div>\n<div><strong>End of June (date and location to be confirmed)</strong></div>\n<div>After the cricket initiation sessions held in primary schools and colleges in Gard‚Äîparticularly as part of the <em>Sports at College</em> program supported by the Gard Department‚Äîcome and cheer on our young budding talents and support your favorite team!<br><br></div>\n<div>A great day of sports, fair play, and discovery!<br><strong>Stay tuned...</strong><br>---</div>','8c414500f98c84ef39420524c560f9fc:306d0d0ecb5b84ffa6a36008b120a4be',1,'2026-06-02 11:47:26'),(44,'Samedi 20 juin : AG ET TOURNOI CRICKET FEMININ','samedi-20-juin-ag-et-tournoi-cricket-feminin','<h1><strong>Samedi 20 juin : SAVE THE DATE ! &nbsp;</strong></h1><h1><strong>Terrain de cricket - Dions&nbsp;</strong></h1><div><br></div><div><strong>Matin (10h‚Äì12h) : AG du N√Æmes Cricket Club + pique-nique partag√©&nbsp;</strong></div><ul><li>10h-12h : AG - Nous recherchons des b√©n√©voles ! Venez vous engager √† nos c√¥t√©s pour faire grandir le projet !</li><li>12h-13h30 : Pique Nique partag√© : viandes froides et salades √† prix libre ou apportez votre propre pique-nique</li></ul><div>Merci d‚Äôindiquer votre pr√©sence en cliquant sur ce lien : <a href=\"https://beta.framadate.org/polls/AG-NCC\"><strong>INSCRIPTION AG</strong></a><br><br><strong>Apr√®s-midi (13h30‚Äì20h):&nbsp; Tournoi f√©minin de cricket</strong><br>Le premier tournoi f√©minin de toute l‚Äôhistoire de l‚ÄôOccitanie !<br>D√©butantes bienvenue !<br>Au programme :&n