>\nRegister by clicking this link: <a href=\"https://www.helloasso.com/associations/nimescricketclub/evenements/festival-de-cricket-feminin-journee-internationale-des-droits-\"><strong>TOURNAMENT REGISTRATION</strong></a><strong><br></strong><br>\n<strong>We look forward to seeing many of you there!</strong><br>\nFeel free to contact us for more information.<br>\nSee you soon!</div>\n<div><br></div>','e43574659d2d0d26d0f98abee65e7b69:fd9ce94907b55473fa1c0360b06b97cd',1,'2026-06-09 12:42:50'),(45,'Report du tournoi f√©minin de cricket','report-du-tournoi-feminin-de-cricket','<div>En raison des fortes chaleurs annonc√©es demain et du faible nombre de participantes inscrites, nous sommes au regret de devoir annuler une nouvelle fois le tournoi de cricket f√©minin.<br><br></div><div>Le tournoi est report√© au mois d\'octobre. Nous esp√©rons vous y retrouver nombreuses pour faire de cette √©dition une belle r√©ussite !<br><br></div><div>Merci de votre compr√©hension et √† tr√®s bient√¥t sur le terrain.<br><br></div><div><br><br><br></div>','2026-06-19-9be9c87c-75e5-4bab-b275-60e7dfd3e890.png','2026-06-19 14:43:02','2026-06-19 14:47:31','Women\'s cricket tournament postponed','<div>Due to the high temperatures forecasted for tomorrow and the low number of registered participants, we regret to announce that we have to cancel the women\'s cricket tournament once again.<br><br></div><div>The tournament is postponed to October. We hope to see many of you there to make this edition a great success!<br><br></div><div>Thank you for your understanding and see you soon on the field.<br><br></div><div><br><br><br></div>','41ddb30c3eeea8a77f64ee159d87dfe6:0393ac4b1fb7629673207e682e460274',1,'2026-06-19 14:47:31'),(46,'Stage Cricket et multisport du 16 au 18 juillet!','cet-ete-decouvre-le-cricket-et-le-multisport-avec-le-nimes-cricket-club-by-asptt','<div>Cet √©t√©, d√©couvre le <strong>cricket et le multisport</strong> avec le N√Æmes Cricket Club by ASPTT !&nbsp;</div><div><br>Rejoins-nous pour un stage d\'initiation au cricket et au multisport ouvert √† tous les enfants √† partir de 7 ans !</div><div><br></div><div><strong>Quand ?&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</strong>Les 16, 17 et 18 juillet</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; De 9h √† 12h</div><div><strong>O√π ?&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Terrain de cricket de Dions</div><div><strong>Combien ?</strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; 50‚Ç¨ les 3 jours<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 20‚Ç¨ la journ√©e<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Gratuit pour les adh√©rents</div><div><strong>Au programme :</strong></div><ul><li>&nbsp;Initiation au cricket : apprendre les bases, jouer et s\'amuser.</li><li>&nbsp;D√©couverte de la p√©tanque et du tennis de table.</li><li>&nbsp;Des jeux, des d√©fis et de nombreux moments de partage dans une ambiance conviviale.</li></ul><div><br></div><div>&nbsp;Petit bonus : le cricket est un sport anglais‚Ä¶ l\'occasion parfaite de travailler ton anglais sans m√™me t\'en rendre compte !&nbsp;<br><br></div><div><strong>√Ä pr√©voir :</strong></div><div>- Une gourde</div><div>- Une casquette ou un chapeau</div><div>- Une protection solaire</div><div><br></div><div><strong>Inscription</strong> en cliquant sur le lien : <a href=\"https://www.helloasso.com/associations/nimescricketclub/adhesions/stage-de-cricket-et-initiation-multisport-dions-2026\"><strong>INSCRIPTION</strong></a></div><div><br></div><div>Contact :<br>&nbsp;<a href=\"mailto:sports@nimescricketclub.fr\">sports@nimescricketclub.fr</a></div><div>06 11 91 92 35</div><div><br></div><div>Les places sont limit√©es, pensez √† r√©server rapidement !</div><div><br></div><div>N\'h√©sitez pas √† partager cette annonce pour faire d√©couvrir le cricket autour de vous !&nbsp;</div>','2026-07-09-6d61c84a-97e9-4a03-ad41-68492c0c66ae.jpg','2026-07-09 12:22:43','2026-07-09 12:53:52','Cricket and multisport camp from July 16 to 18!','<div>This summer, discover <strong>cricket and multisport</strong> with the N√Æmes Cricket Club by ASPTT!</div>\n<div><br>Join us for an introductory cricket and multisport camp open to all children from 7 years old!</div>\n<div><br></div>\n<div><strong>When?&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</strong>July 16, 17, and 18</div>\n<div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; From 9 AM to 12 PM</div>\n<div><strong>Where?&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Dions cricket field</div>\n<div><strong>How much?</strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; ‚Ç¨50 for 3 days<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ‚Ç¨20 per day<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Free for members</div>\n<div><strong>Program:</strong></div>\n<ul>\n<li>&nbsp;Introduction to cricket: learn the basics, play, and have fun.</li>\n<li>&nbsp;Discovery of p√©tanque and table tennis.</li>\n<li>&nbsp;Games, challenges, and many moments of sharing in a friendly atmosphere.</li>\n</ul>\n<div><br></div>\n<div>&nbsp;Little bonus: cricket is an English sport‚Ä¶ the perfect opportunity to practice your English without even realizing it!&nbsp;<br><br></div>\n<div><strong>What to bring:</strong></div>\n<div>- A water bottle</div>\n<div>- A cap or hat</div>\n<div>- Sun protection</div>\n<div><br></div>\n<div><strong>Registration</strong> by clicking on the link: <a href=\"https://www.helloasso.com/associations/nimescricketclub/adhesions/stage-de-cricket-et-initiation-multisport-dions-2026\"><strong>REGISTER</strong></a></div>\n<div><br></div>\n<div>Contact:<br>&nbsp;<a href=\"mailto:sports@nimescricketclub.fr\">sports@nimescricketclub.fr</a></div>\n<div>06 11 91 92 35</div>\n<div><br></div>\n<div>Spots are limited, remember to book quickly!</div>\n<div><br></div>\n<div>Feel free to share this announcement to introduce cricket to those around you!</div>','642a5018676ee41e7199b33646cee1a1:392777e56799b5b8c8faf1a5b83a2a70',1,'2026-07-09 12:53:52'),(47,'VIENS JOUER AU CRICKET !','cest-la-reprise-du-cricket-a-nimes','<div>C\'est la reprise des cours de cricket et cette ann√©e, le terrain d‚Äôentra√Ænement du <strong>N√Æmes Cricket Club revient √† N√Æmes</strong>, apr√®s un an et demi pass√© √† Dions !<br><br></div><div>Vous avez envie de <strong>retrouver le club</strong>, de <strong>d√©couvrir un nouveau sport</strong>, de progresser ou simplement de partager un bon moment dans une ambiance conviviale ?<br><br></div><div>üëâ <strong>Rendez-vous tous les samedis au Stade des Courbiers ‚Äì Hippodrome de N√Æmes !<br></strong><br></div><div>üë¶ <strong>Jeunes de 6 √† 16 ans</strong><br>üïô 10h ‚Äì 12h<br><br></div><div>üèè <strong>Adultes (+16 ans)</strong><br>üïê 13h ‚Äì 15h30<br><br></div><div><strong>D√©butants comme joueurs confirm√©s sont les bienvenus !<br></strong><br></div><div>Le cricket, c‚Äôest de la <strong>technique, du plaisir et surtout un v√©ritable esprit d‚Äô√©quipe</strong>. Venez essayer et d√©couvrir pourquoi ce sport rassemble des millions de passionn√©s √† travers le monde !<br><br></div><div>üöå <strong>Transport gratuit depuis la Gare Feuch√®res</strong><br>D√©parts vers l‚ÄôHippodrome : <strong>9h15 et 12h45<br></strong><br></div><div>üì© <strong>Infos &amp; inscriptions : </strong><a href=\"mailto:contact@nimescricketclub.fr\"><strong>contact@nimescricketclub.fr</strong></a><br>üìû <strong>06 11 91 92 35<br></strong><br></div><div><strong>N√Æmes Cricket Club ‚Äì Venez jouer, d√©couvrir et partager !</strong> üèè<br><br><figure data-trix-attachment=\"{&quot;contentType&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;filename&quot;:&quot;Flyer 2026-27 - p1.jpg&quot;,&quot;filesize&quot;:346397,&quot;height&quot;:2000,&quot;href&quot;:&quot;/attachments/89faed14-d8dc-49ed-8581-3feb9e1bdb0c.jpg&quot;,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;/attachments/89faed14-d8dc-49ed-8581-3feb9e1bdb0c.jpg&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:1414}\" data-trix-content-type=\"image/jpeg\" data-trix-attributes=\"{&quot;presentation&quot;:&quot;gallery&quot;}\" class=\"attachment attachment--preview attachment--jpg\"><a href=\"/attachments/89faed14-d8dc-49ed-8581-3feb9e1bdb0c.jpg\"><img src=\"/attachments/89faed14-d8dc-49ed-8581-3feb9e1bdb0c.jpg\" width=\"1414\" height=\"2000\"><figcaption class=\"attachment__caption\"><span class=\"attachment__name\">Flyer 2026-27 - p1.jpg</span> <span class=\"attachment__size\">338.28 KB</span></figcaption></a></figure><br><br><figure data-trix-attachment=\"{&quot;contentType&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;filename&quot;:&quot;Flyer 2026-27 - p2.jpg&quot;,&quot;filesize&quot;:370966,&quot;height&quot;:2000,&quot;href&quot;:&quot;/attachments/a7380421-5cfc-45ee-9682-80850f427cb3.jpg&quot;,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;/attachments/a7380421-5cfc-45ee-9682-80850f427cb3.jpg&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:1414}\" data-trix-content-type=\"image/jpeg\" data-trix-attributes=\"{&quot;presentation&quot;:&quot;gallery&quot;}\" class=\"attachment attachment--preview attachment--jpg\"><a href=\"/attachments/a7380421-5cfc-45ee-9682-80850f427cb3.jpg\"><img src=\"/attachments/a7380421-5cfc-45ee-9682-80850f427cb3.jpg\" width=\"1414\" height=\"2000\"><figcaption class=\"attachment__caption\"><span class=\"attachment__name\">Flyer 2026-27 - p2.jpg</span> <span class=\"attachment__size\">362.27 KB</span></figcaption></a></figure><br><br></div>','2026-09-23-ee31f902-e7dc-40a4-bb0b-b247af9d6881.jpg','2026-09-23 18:00:57','2026-09-23 20:22:54','COME PLAY CRICKET!','<div>It\'s the resumption of cricket classes and this year, the training ground of the <strong>N√Æmes Cricket Club is returning to N√Æmes</strong>, after a year and a half spent in Dions!<br><br></div>\n<div>Do you want to <strong>rejoin the club</strong>, <strong>discover a new sport</strong>, improve or simply share a good time in a friendly atmosphere?<br><br></div>\n<div>üëâ <strong>Meet every Saturday at Stade des Courbiers ‚Äì Hippodrome de N√Æmes!<br></strong><br></div>\n<div>üë¶ <strong>Youth from 6 to 16 years old</strong><br>üïô 10am ‚Äì 12pm<br><br></div>\n<div>üèè <strong>Adults (16+ years)</strong><br>üïê 1pm ‚Äì 3:30pm<br><br></div>\n<div><strong>Beginners and experienced players are all welcome!</strong><br><br></div>\n<div>Cricket is about <strong>technique, fun, and above all a true team spirit</strong>. Come try and discover why this sport brings together millions of enthusiasts around the world!<br><br></div>\n<div>üöå <strong>Free transport from Gare Feuch√®res</strong><br>Departures to the Hippodrome: <strong>9:15am and 12:45pm<br></strong><br></div>\n<div>üì© <strong>Info & registrations: </strong><a href=\"mailto:contact@nimescricketclub.fr\"><strong>contact@nimescricketclub.fr</strong></a><br>üìû <strong>06 11 91 92 35<br></strong><br></div>\n<div><strong>N√Æmes Cricket Club ‚Äì Come play, discover, and share!</strong> üèè<br><br>\n<figure data-trix-attachment=\"{&quot;contentType&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;filename&quot;:&quot;Flyer 2026-27 - p1.jpg&quot;,&quot;filesize&quot;:346397,&quot;height&quot;:2000,&quot;href&quot;:&quot;/attachments/89faed14-d8dc-49ed-8581-3feb9e1bdb0c.jpg&quot;,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;/attachments/89faed14-d8dc-49ed-8581-3feb9e1bdb0c.jpg&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:1414}\" data-trix-content-type=\"image/jpeg\" data-trix-attributes=\"{&quot;presentation&quot;:&quot;gallery&quot;}\" class=\"attachment attachment--preview attachment--jpg\"><a href=\"/attachments/89faed14-d8dc-49ed-8581-3feb9e1bdb0c.jpg\"><img src=\"/attachments/89faed14-d8dc-49ed-8581-3feb9e1bdb0c.jpg\" width=\"1414\" height=\"2000\"><figcaption class=\"attachment__caption\"><span class=\"attachment__name\">Flyer 2026-27 - p1.jpg</span> <span class=\"attachment__size\">338.28 KB</span></figcaption></a></figure><br><br>\n<figure data-trix-attachment=\"{&quot;contentType&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;filename&quot;:&quot;Flyer 2026-27 - p2.jpg&quot;,&quot;filesize&quo