/div><div>üèè <strong>AU PROGRAMME : CRICKET EN ANGLAIS, RENCONTRES ET ESPRIT D‚Äô√âQUIPE !<br></strong><br></div><div>√Ä travers un tournoi de <strong>softball cricket</strong>, les √©l√®ves vont jouer, communiquer en anglais, coop√©rer et d√©couvrir les valeurs du cricket : <strong>fair-play, respect, inclusion et esprit d‚Äô√©quipe</strong>.<br><br></div><div>üèÜ Et parce que gagner ne se r√©sume pas au nombre de runs, la <strong>Spirit of Cricket Cup 2026</strong> mettra √† l‚Äôhonneur l‚Äô√©quipe qui incarnera le mieux <strong>l‚Äôesprit du cricket</strong> tout au long de la matin√©e.<br><br></div><div>üé∂ <strong>LE CRICKET RENCONTRE AUSSI LA CULTURE OCCITANE !</strong></div><div>Un groupe de musique traditionnelle occitane accompagnera l‚Äô√©v√©nement et ponctuera les moments forts du tournoi.<br><br></div><div>Pour les √©l√®ves du <strong>Coll√®ge Henri Rouvi√®re ‚Äì Le Bleymard</strong>, qui √©tudient l‚Äôanglais et l‚Äôoccitan, cette journ√©e s‚Äôinscrit pleinement dans leur s√©jour dans le Gard : <strong>pratiquer les langues autrement, d√©couvrir un nouveau sport, rencontrer d‚Äôautres coll√©giens et partager la culture locale.<br></strong><br></div><div>ü§ù <strong>Jouer ensemble. Communiquer. D√©couvrir. Encourager. Partager.<br></strong><br></div><div>üôè Le N√Æmes Cricket Club remercie <strong>tout particuli√®rement la commune de Dions et le D√©partement du Gard qui soutient ce projet dans le cadre du dispositif \"Sportifs au coll√®ge\"</strong>, ainsi que les <strong>enseignants et √©quipes √©ducatives du Coll√®ge Henri Rouvi√®re ‚Äì Le Bleymard et du Coll√®ge Jean Rostand</strong> pour leur engagement et leur soutien.<br><br></div><div><br><strong>CRICKET ‚Ä¢ LANGUES ‚Ä¢ CULTURE ‚Ä¢ FAIR-PLAY ‚Ä¢ PARTAGE<br></strong><br></div><div>#SpiritOfCricketCup2026 #CricketEnAnglais #NimesCricketClub #Dions #Gard #Lozere #Occitanie #Intercolleges #Sport #Education #Langues #Culture #SpiritOfCricket<br><br><figure data-trix-attachment=\"{&quot;contentType&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;filename&quot;:&quot;Affiche tournoi.jpg&quot;,&quot;filesize&quot;:319124,&quot;height&quot;:2000,&quot;href&quot;:&quot;/attachments/8e7ae3e5-63b6-401c-9576-b264ccdde2c3.jpg&quot;,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;/attachments/8e7ae3e5-63b6-401c-9576-b264ccdde2c3.jpg&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:1414}\" data-trix-content-type=\"image/jpeg\" data-trix-attributes=\"{&quot;presentation&quot;:&quot;gallery&quot;}\" class=\"attachment attachment--preview attachment--jpg\"><a href=\"/attachments/8e7ae3e5-63b6-401c-9576-b264ccdde2c3.jpg\"><img src=\"/attachments/8e7ae3e5-63b6-401c-9576-b264ccdde2c3.jpg\" width=\"1414\" height=\"2000\"><figcaption class=\"attachment__caption\"><span class=\"attachment__name\">Affiche tournoi.jpg</span> <span class=\"attachment__size\">311.64 KB</span></figcaption></a></figure><br><br><br></div>','2026-10-10-a719bead-46b0-4a6b-b979-76e0d85180e9.png','2026-10-10 18:06:22','2026-10-10 18:46:34','15 October Inter-College Tournament!','<div><strong>Cricket, English, Occitan music... and above all the spirit of the game!<br></strong><br></div>\n<div>The <strong>N√Æmes Cricket Club</strong> will bring together nearly <strong>66 middle school students</strong> for a sports and cultural morning like no other:<br><br></div>\n<div>üëâ students from <strong>4th and 3rd grade of Coll√®ge Henri Rouvi√®re ‚Äì Le Bleymard (Loz√®re)</strong><br>üëâ two classes of <strong>6th grade from Coll√®ge Jean Rostand - N√Æmes (Gard)<br></strong><br></div>\n<div>üìÖ <strong>Thursday, October 15th</strong><br>üïò <strong>9 AM ‚Äì 12 PM</strong><br>üìç <strong>Cricket field of Dions<br></strong><br></div>\n<div>üéüÔ∏è <strong>FREE ENTRY FOR SPECTATORS!</strong><br>Parents, families, residents, and the curious are all welcome to come and discover cricket and cheer on the young players! üëèüèè<br><br></div>\n<div>üç¥ü•§ <strong>FOOD & DRINKS ON SITE</strong><br>The <strong>Guinguette L‚ÄôEstanco Dions</strong> will be open to welcome you during the event.<br><br></div>\n<div>üèè <strong>ON THE PROGRAM: CRICKET IN ENGLISH, MEETINGS, AND TEAM SPIRIT!<br></strong><br></div>\n<div>Through a <strong>softball cricket</strong> tournament, the students will play, communicate in English, cooperate, and discover the values of cricket: <strong>fair-play, respect, inclusion, and team spirit</strong>.<br><br></div>\n<div>üèÜ And because winning isn\'t just about the number of runs, the <strong>Spirit of Cricket Cup 2026</strong> will honor the team that best embodies the <strong>spirit of cricket</strong> throughout the morning.<br><br></div>\n<div>üé∂ <strong>CRICKET ALSO MEETS OCCITAN CULTURE!</strong></div>\n<div>A traditional Occitan music group will accompany the event and punctuate the highlights of the tournament.<br><br></div>\n<div>For the students of <strong>Coll√®ge Henri Rouvi√®re ‚Äì Le Bleymard</strong>, who study English and Occitan, this day is fully part of their stay in the Gard: <strong>practicing languages differently, discovering a new sport, meeting other middle school students, and sharing local culture.<br></strong><br></div>\n<div>ü§ù <strong>Playing together. Communicating. Discovering. Encouraging. Sharing.<br></strong><br></div>\n<div>üôè The N√Æmes Cricket Club would like to especially thank <strong>the commune of Dions and the Gard Department, which supports this project as part of the \"Sportifs au coll√®ge\" scheme</strong>, as well as the <strong>teachers and educational teams of Coll√®ge Henri Rouvi√®re ‚Äì Le Bleymard and Coll√®ge Jean Rostand</strong> for their commitment and support.<br><br></div>\n<div><br><strong>CRICKET ‚Ä¢ LANGUAGES ‚Ä¢ CULTURE ‚Ä¢ FAIR-PLAY ‚Ä¢ SHARING<br></strong><br></div>\n<div>#SpiritOfCricketCup2026 #CricketInEnglish #NimesCricketClub #Dions #Gard #Lozere #Occitanie #Intercolleges #Sport #Education #Languages #Culture #SpiritOfCricket<br><br>\n<figure data-trix-attachment=\"{&quot;contentType&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;filename&quot;:&quo